ins_message_list: {
  id: 20003
  time: 1775768417
  text: "Three hours after the renowned port explorer, Fu Shun, went missing after embarking on a long-anticipated expedition, we finally received a message from her confirming her safety...\nThe following is an excerpt from her account––\n*\n\"I goofed up! Like, royally! They say curiosity killed the cat and all, but in that instant when I pushed open the ventilation shaft and jumped down, I thought I was ready for anything!\nBut when I looked up, there was the Commander looking back at me, coffee cup in hand, even calmer than during an exercise debriefing!\nCommander just said, 'Oh, you came at just the right time, Fu Shun. I have a report here I'd like you to look over.'\nAnd that's how I ended up stuck behind the desk for the next three hours!! Exercise logs, supply lists, the roster for next month's duties... I can practically see those words even with my eyes closed!\nWait, Commander's totally focused on the coffee machine! This is probably my last chance! Please, someone, come save me! Or at least bring me some late-night snacks!\nJust as I clasped my hands together in prayer, Commander suddenly turned around to look at me! HEEEELP!\"\n*\nAccording to \"Yuen Fei\", an involved party, Fu Shun has yet to return to her lodgings.\nWill Fu Shun's bizarre adventure, already plagued with so many trials and tribulations even since the very outset, meet its end here?\nPlease follow Port Tales to read about the latest developments!"
  picture: "https://blhxusstatic.yo-star.com/pic/260409_OA5bigBXL6ARzz6bGlGjjD.png"
  player_discuss: {
    id: 20003
    time: 0
    text_list: "You're welcome to come explore my office again, any time."
    text_list: "No worries. I can always use another set of helping hands."
    text: ""
  }
  npc_discuss: {
    id: 100083
    time: 1775771657
    text: "yoooo! Fu Shun has defeated the Demon Lord of Overwork and survived to tell the tale!!!!"
    npc_reply: 100084
    npc_reply: 100085
    npc_reply: 100086
    npc_reply: 100087
  }
  npc_discuss: {
    id: 100078
    time: 1775770757
    text: "Oh my, Commander must be working overtime again. I wonder if I should take some late-night snacks over..."
    npc_reply: 100079
    npc_reply: 100080
    npc_reply: 100081
    npc_reply: 100082
  }
  npc_discuss: {
    id: 100074
    time: 1775769857
    text: "Interesting. Looks pretty ambitious. I've gotta give it a try myself next time!"
    npc_reply: 100075
    npc_reply: 100076
    npc_reply: 100077
  }
  npc_discuss: {
    id: 100071
    time: 1775769377
    text: "more importantly, where are the ventilation ducts that lead straight to the office?"
    npc_reply: 100072
    npc_reply: 100073
