ins_message_list: {
  id: 20004
  time: 1776448817
  text: "Announcement! The swimsuit fashion survey hosted by the Port Fashion Collection Editorial Team has officially come to a close!\nThis time, there were no judges or awards, just blunt, honest reviews from the editorial team!\nBased on the results, both sporty and elegant styles are neck-and-neck, offering a true feast for the eyes! But that's not all – the wild, edgy aesthetic is bursting onto the scene as well, setting the stage for a blazing-hot summer!\nWhich swimsuit style will come out on top? Stay tuned to find out!"
  picture: "https://blhxusstatic.yo-star.com/pic/260417_OA6bigobP4JHtJyCjXOBfO.png"
  player_discuss: {
    id: 20004
    time: 0
    text_list: "Sporty and elegant make sense to me, but what does \"wild and edgy\" swimwear look like?"
    text_list: "Speaking of which, when was there a swimsuit survey? I don't recall anything of the sort being sent out..."
    text: ""
  }
  npc_discuss: {
    id: 100114
    time: 1776451757
    text: "How wonderful it would be to bask in the summer sun on the beach in a swimsuit right now..."
    npc_reply: 100115
    npc_reply: 100116
    npc_reply: 100117
  }
  npc_discuss: {
    id: 100110
    time: 1776450857
    text: "Indeed. Practicality should always be top of mind when it comes to choosing swimwear."
    npc_reply: 100111
    npc_reply: 100112
    npc_reply: 100113
  }
  npc_discuss: {
    id: 100108
    time: 1776450497
    text: "I've heard that the less fabric you wear, the faster you swim..."
    npc_reply: 100109
  }
  npc_discuss: {
    id: 100106
    time: 1776450197
    text: "isn't it, like, a bit early to be talking about swimsuits?"
    npc_reply: 100107
  }
  npc_discuss: {
    id: 100103
    time: 1776449717
    text: "Objection! School swimsuits are the best. Always have, always will."
    npc_reply: 100104
    npc_reply: 100105
  }
  npc_discuss: {
    id: 100099
    time: 1776448997
    text: "Question: So, of these options, which style do you prefer most?"
    npc_reply: 100100
    npc_reply: 100101
    npc_reply: 100102
  }
  npc_reply: {
    id: 100117
    time: 1776452357
    text: "Rolling around on an air mattress... super comfy... I like it"
  }
  npc_reply: {
    id: 100116
    time: 1776452117
    text: "Maintaining the dignity and elegance of one's nobility can be considered a form of fashion in and of itself."
  }
  npc_reply: {
    id: 100115
    time: 1776451877
    text: "Sitting atop a floaty ring like a throne, casting your gaze down across your domain... What a wonderful sight that would be."
  }
  npc_reply: {
    id: 100113
    time: 1776451517
    text: "hahaha! when Enty gets serious, there isn't a soul who can swim faster than her. doesn't matter what she's wearing!"
  }
  npc_reply: {
    id: 100112
    time: 1776451277
    text: "Huh? Isn't that the point...?"
  }
  npc_reply: {
    id: 100111
    time: 1776451097
    text: "So you're going swimming too, Enterprise?"
  }
  npc_reply: {
    id: 100109
    time: 1776450617
    text: "OMG, you absolutely speak the truth, sister! When I tried jumping into the water wearing my old swimsuit, it felt as if there was nothing between me and the water, nothing to get in my way! I kept cutting through the water, gliding through it effortlessly"
  }
  npc_reply: {
    id: 100107
    time: 1776450377
    text: "How could you say such an appalling thing?! Fashion is all about staying ahead of the curve!"
  }
  npc_reply: {
    id: 100105
    time: 1776450017
    text: "If you're going to swim, wouldn't something more standard and functional be better...?"
  }
  npc_reply: {
    id: 100104
    time: 1776449897
    text: "hear, hear!"
  }
  npc_reply: {
    id: 100102
    time: 1776449537
    text: "Yes, but it's that dissonance between elegant and edgy that truly makes your appeal pop."
  }
  npc_reply: {
    id: 100101
    time: 1776449417
    text: "I prefer something more reserved and elegant. The attentiveness to detail that goes into the swimsuit's design really adds to the appeal."
  }
  npc_reply: {
    id: 100100
    time: 1776449177
    text: "It's gotta be the athletic type, right? That kind of look, brimming with energy, basically makes you a walking spotlight!"
  }
