ins_message_list: {
  id: 20006
  time: 1780002017
  text: "\"When you fail, you can always find another starting point to get back on your feet.\" – That's explorer Fu Shun's motto!\nHaving overcome her latest tribulations, she heads for the unexplored volcano near the port, launching her adventure into a new chapter!\n\n\"My adventure in the Commander's office was a wash, but I found someplace that'll really rouse my adventurous spirit!\" – Specifically, the crater of a volcano.\n\nThere's no such thing as giving up for an explorer! All they know is to step forth, right now, without delay!\n––\nEverything went super smooth at first. I found some strange-shaped volcanic rocks and decided to bring them back for Tai Yuan.\n\nBut when I got halfway up the volcano, it got reeeally foggy and I couldn't see a thing! Before I knew it, I couldn't find the way I just came from!\n\nI was seriously wondering if you could eat volcanic rocks for dinner when... Wait! \n\nFootsteps?! And someone's calling my name?!\nGuess what? An Shan, Tai Yuan, and Chang Chun have come looking for me! Waaah! I'm saved!"
  picture: "https://blhxusstatic.yo-star.com/pic/260528_OA8bigi5sZESxn8ofVpPzn.png"
  player_discuss: {
    id: 20006
    time: 0
    text_list: "Make sure you bring plenty of provisions on your next adventure."
    text_list: "Why don't we make the crater a new tourist attraction, since everyone's so interested?"
    text: ""
  }
