ins_message_list: {
  id: 20007
  time: 1781302620
  text: "It has been more than four hours since Fu Shun once again landed on the volcanic island. From the peak, she shared with us words befitting a true explorer.\n——*\nI counted 123 steps when the volcano decided to wake up and I felt the heat under my feet!\nThe smell of sulfur stung my eyes and I rubbed them with my sleeve as I climbed. I kept telling myself the whole way that this was a real adventure! One that meant something!\n——\nAnd then I saw the peak!\nIt was quieter than I thought it'd be. I couldn't hear the grumble of erupting magma. Only the wind whistled between the gaps in the rocks.\nI got on the ground and peeked into the open orange crater. Something was moving down there. Something slow and heavy, like a giant turning in its sleep. A light came up from the abyss and flashed as it lit up my face.\nI don't know why, but my fear totally disappeared then. The volcano knew I was there, and it shall prove it!"
  picture: "https://blhxusstatic.yo-star.com/pic/260612_OA9bigNVUIHu6v1uLB01qw.png"
  player_discuss: {
    id: 20007
    time: 0
    text_list: "It's too dangerous out there. Come back and help me with my work."
    text_list: "Does anyone need this guide on safe volcano hiking?"
    text: ""
  }
