  time: 1782428400
  text: "The New Dream Circus recently opened its first show at the port. The wonderful performance attracted a huge response, with repeat ticket sales rate at an astounding 63.7%!\nThe PR team said \"We never expected the show to be so popular. And we will surely hone our skills even more going forward. Right now, we're recruiting team members to join our training for the new program, so we ask anyone who's interested to check our newsletter.\""
