ins_message_list: {
  id: 20010
  time: 1784837700
  text: "Strange and supernatural happenings have been occurring all over the port one after another. We spoke to ghost-story author Prinz Moritz, who is said to have a full understanding of the port's shadowy secrets, to see if we could solve the mystery.\nHere is a transcript of the interview.\n––\nS: As a writer of ghost stories, do you think there's a link between your tales and these spooky occurrences?\nM: Rather than a link, I think these events are best understood as a manifestation of ghost stories. We're already in a huge world of terrifying tales, and... (long explanation cut for brevity).\nS: By the way, there's been a recent rise in reported ghost sightings at night. What's that all about?\nM: (Immediately) It's that ghost doctor looking for patients! I just know it!\nS: Then what about the dormitory doors opening by themselves?! Are the dorms haunted?\nM: For sure. That's the ghost head nurse doing her midnight rounds...\nS: How are you so sure that this is all the work of ghosts? It's not like you were there, right? Unless...\nM: Oh, you know! Heehehehe! I think the head nurse wants to give you a checkup, reporter!\n––\nThe transcript ends here."
  picture: "https://blhxusstatic.yo-star.com/pic/260723_OA10bigZCgkmw5jYod5t5Jr.png"
  player_discuss: {
    id: 20010
    time: 0
    text_list: "Are ghost stories actually real?"
    text_list: "The other night, the office door opened by itself..."
    text: ""
  }
