ins_message_list: {
  id: 20012
  time: 1786658400
  text: "The port will soon be filled with roaring race cars. Have you got your racewear ready yet?\nAfter a heated discussion, the editorial department put together a comprehensive checklist.\nOne-piece race suit: You can't get much more awesome, but they're a pain to take off! Maybe there's someone (the Commander) you could ask for help?\nTwo-piece race suit with jacket: glamorous and refined. Try putting the jacket around a certain someone's shoulders (the Commander) so you can share the joy of victory!\nOf course, if you'd rather enhance the charms you've already got, feel free to try a different approach."
  picture: "https://blhxusstatic.yo-star.com/pic/260813_OA12bigzm6ZjifVJDQrGZvQ.png"
  player_discuss: {
    id: 20012
    time: 0
    text_list: "The outfits that stand out are the ones that balance style with practicality."
    text_list: "What does \"different approach\" mean, anyway?"
    text: ""
  }
  npc_discuss: {
    id: 100385
    time: 1786662000
    text: "There are some outfits that are perfect for driving and for certain other activities too."
    npc_reply: 100386
    npc_reply: 100387
    npc_reply: 100388
    npc_reply: 100389
  }
  npc_discuss: {
    id: 100380
    time: 1786661040
    text: "Racewear has to be suitable for driving! Getting a one-piece that fits just right is the way to go!"
    npc_reply: 100381
    npc_reply: 100382
    npc_reply: 100383
    npc_reply: 100384
  }
  npc_discuss: {
    id: 100377
    time: 1786660380
    text: "Looks are super important when picking an outfit for something like this right? Not that I'm an expert."
    npc_reply: 100378
    npc_reply: 100379
  }
  npc_discuss: {
    id: 100375
    time: 1786660080
    text: "It's fine for you to focus on selecting your outfits, but don't forget to check the condition of your cars too."
    npc_reply: 100376
  }
  npc_discuss: {
    id: 100370
    time: 1786659180
    text: "I've received several orders for outfits for the competition, but I've never made clothing with these materials..."
    npc_reply: 100371
    npc_reply: 100372
    npc_reply: 100373
    npc_reply: 100374
  }
  npc_discuss: {
    id: 100367
    time: 1786658580
    text: "One-piece suits CAN get a bit stuffy. I guess I'll try out the two-piece this time."
    npc_reply: 100368
    npc_reply: 100369
  }
  npc_reply: {
    id: 100389
    time: 1786662780
    text: "I see the race is not limited to cars going around the track... Perhaps it is time to test the results of my training."
  }
  npc_reply: {
    id: 100388
    time: 1786662600
    text: "I believe you would be well suited to confer the awards..."
  }
  npc_reply: {
    id: 100387
    time: 1786662420
    text: "You're talking about cheering, right? Right??"
  }
  npc_reply: {
    id: 100386
    time: 1786662240
    text: "You're so right~ There's more to a race than just driving. Lots more~"
  }
  npc_reply: {
    id: 100384
    time: 1786661820
    text: "I was just helping the Commander relax!"
  }
  npc_reply: {
    id: 100383
    time: 1786661580
    text: "You were SUPPOSED to be doing maintenance till you ended up playing in the water with the Commander..."
  }
  npc_reply: {
    id: 100382
    time: 1786661400
    text: "That wasn't for driving! That was so I could do maintenance more easily!"
  }
  npc_reply: {
    id: 100381
    time: 1786661280
    text: "Hm? I wouldn't say what you wore earlier WAS very suitable, Essex..."
  }
  npc_reply: {
    id: 100379
    time: 1786660800
    text: "A bolt of red lightning whizzing by – I could dominate everyone's attention if I aim for that!"
  }
  npc_reply: {
    id: 100378
    time: 1786660560
    text: "You betcha! Anyone's first thought is gonna be \"whoa, that's awesome!\" when they see ya speed by like a hero in your car, right?"
  }
  npc_reply: {
    id: 100376
    time: 1786660260
    text: "Do stop by the pits if you need us."
  }
  npc_reply: {
    id: 100374
    time: 1786659900
    text: "I'd really appreciate that! Let's do it together, the three of us!"
  }
  npc_reply: {
    id: 100373
    time: 1786659720
    text: "I got lots of requests too... Can I make the outfits with you?"
  }
  npc_reply: {
    id: 100372
    time: 1786659480
    text: "I'm always here to lend a hand if you need it."
  }
  npc_reply: {
    id: 100371
    time: 1786659360
    text: "Material can influence the design a great deal, but I'm sure you'll have no problem, Watarase. You're fantastic at making patterns."
  }
  npc_reply: {
    id: 100369
    time: 1786658940
    text: "That's a great idea! I'm off to go pick out a new jacket!"
  }
  npc_reply: {
    id: 100368
    time: 1786658820
    text: "Why not use the opportunity to show a different side of yourself and offer the Commander your passenger seat?"
  }
