ins_message_list: {
  id: 20014
  time: 1789678800
  text: "The Sakura Empire Hot Springs are holding a limited-time promotion starting today! Our reporter Alfredo was invited to cover the event. What was supposed to be a relaxing trip to the hot springs turned into a scene of panic when cries for help were suddenly heard.\n\"Th-there's a ghost!\"\nWhen she rushed to the scene, she found Owari in a state of distress, with one terrified Suruga not far away. From their accounts, she was able to put together the story as follows.\nWhile soaking in the hot spring, Owari noticed a white figure standing in the hazy steam. Assuming it to be a prank, she approached to see who it was. However, no matter how far she went, the white figure remained just as far away.\nSensing something was amiss, she called over Suruga. The two of them split up to corner the figure, but just as they were about to close in, the mysterious stranger vanished, leaving not a trace behind.\n\nAfter that, Alfredo accompanied Owari to the scene, but the two of them found nothing unusual. However, Owari and Suruga remained adamant that they had witnessed a ghost.\nTo uncover the truth, our reporter planned to launch a ghost-hunting series titled \"In Pursuit of Science, Port Edition\" but management warned that filming on the premises would incur a hefty fee.\nCurrently, we're looking for sponsors to help get this project off the ground! If you're interested in supporting this scientific initiative, please leave a comment below."
  picture: "https://blhxusstatic.yo-star.com/pic/260917_OA14bigukrr0pziM8Jfxtto.png"
  player_discuss: {
    id: 20014
    time: 0
    text_list: "A hot spring where you get to pet foxes? That sounds great."
    text_list: "Well, that case sure got cracked quickly..."
    text: ""
  }
  npc_discuss: {
    id: 100457
    time: 1789682700
    text: "That white silhouette must have been... my fox sneaking out to play! I am deeply sorry for the misunderstanding!"
    npc_reply: 100458
    npc_reply: 100459
    npc_reply: 100460
  }
  npc_discuss: {
    id: 100455
    time: 1789682460
    text: "A ghost? Psssh. You must've been fooled by my dazzling appearance!"
    npc_reply: 100456
  }
  npc_discuss: {
    id: 100454
    time: 1789682280
    text: "Nor was it my other Self. We were cleaning up together."
  }
  npc_discuss: {
    id: 100453
    time: 1789682160
    text: "It wasn't Foo, either. We were watching a movie together at the time."
  }
  npc_discuss: {
    id: 100452
    time: 1789681920
    text: "It wasn't me. I was still working at the co-op..."
  }
  npc_discuss: {
    id: 100450
    time: 1789681560
    text: "Ohoh?! Are ghosts really real?"
    npc_reply: 100451
  }
  npc_discuss: {
    id: 100445
    time: 1789680660
    text: "This sounds like a case for me and Data 857!"
    npc_reply: 100446
    npc_reply: 100447
    npc_reply: 100448
    npc_reply: 100449
  }
  npc_discuss: {
    id: 100442
    time: 1789680000
    text: "I like the sound of that series of yours, but it doesn't quite meet my investment criteria."
    npc_reply: 100443
    npc_reply: 100444
  }
  npc_discuss: {
    id: 100441
    time: 1789679760
    text: "A white phantom amidst the steamy hot springs... How intriguing. I can feel the inspiration brewing~"
  }
  npc_discuss: {
    id: 100436
    time: 1789678920
    text: "Don't care if it's a ghost, ghoul, or whatever. I'll cut it down in a single slash!"
    npc_reply: 100437
    npc_reply: 100438
    npc_reply: 100439
    npc_reply: 100440
  }
  npc_reply: {
    id: 100460
    time: 1789683180
    text: "Of course you may. I would be happy to bring it along myself."
  }
  npc_reply: {
    id: 100459
    time: 1789683060
    text: "If it comes over again... are we allowed to pet it?"
  }
  npc_reply: {
    id: 100458
    time: 1789682940
    text: "Oooh, that's what it was? No worries, then!"
  }
  npc_reply: {
    id: 100456
    time: 1789682580
    text: "I don't think the two are related..."
  }
  npc_reply: {
    id: 100451
    time: 1789681680
    text: "If anybody could befriend a ghost, it would be Dmitri..."
  }
  npc_reply: {
    id: 100449
    time: 1789681380
    text: "Hey, come on! This is supposed to be MY exclusive scoop!"
  }
  npc_reply: {
    id: 100448
    time: 1789681260
    text: "Ooh! That sounds fun. I'm in!"
  }
  npc_reply: {
    id: 100447
    time: 1789681020
    text: "I'll go, too! I can be the hero who faces the ghosts in the perilous fog!"
  }
  npc_reply: {
    id: 100446
    time: 1789680780
    text: "I have some new gear that might help. Don't leave home without it!"
  }
  npc_reply: {
    id: 100444
    time: 1789680420
    text: "Aliens? Brilliant! Take my money already!"
  }
  npc_reply: {
    id: 100443
    time: 1789680180
    text: "We're actually looking to uncover a way bigger truth: it might not be ghosts that are haunting the port, but rather, ALIENS!"
  }
  npc_reply: {
    id: 100440
    time: 1789679520
    text: "No problem. My fists work just as well!"
  }
  npc_reply: {
    id: 100439
    time: 1789679400
    text: "You can't take blades into the hot spring! Ask me how I know..."
  }
  npc_reply: {
    id: 100438
    time: 1789679280
    text: "Do swords work on ghosts?"
  }
  npc_reply: {
    id: 100437
    time: 1789679100
    text: "Kii, you're a real gal's gal!"
  }
