ins_message_list: {
  id: 20015
  time: 1791493200
  text: "\"Everyone says they love romance, but what kind of romance are you into?\" \nLately, the director of Dash of Romance Publishing has been wanting to gather ideas for questions without a single answer!\nIs it about the sudden flutter of a heart?\nA feeling you can't put into words?\nOr something small that glows with its own secret light and is often overlooked?\nIt was with these questions in mind that editor Aoba set about her Romance Anthology Plan.\n I want to ask the readers of this article: What shape does the romance in YOUR heart take? \n The answer might be closer than you think.\nIt might be hiding in the life you're living at this very moment. Please do share your thoughts with us.\nWe'll be reading through all the replies. \n If any happen to tug at our heartstrings, we'll send you a small gift as thanks: a magazine from Dash of Romance Publishing and some merchandise♪\nThank you so much for reading this article! We are Dash of Romance Publishing. \nWe'll weave our romantic poetry through the rest of our pages!"
  picture: "https://blhxusstatic.yo-star.com/pic/261008_OA15bigAuZ7tbQNBGWzGoJ4.png"
  player_discuss: {
    id: 20015
    time: 0
    text_list: "Looks like you've all got your own ideas about what romance is."
    text_list: "What romance means to me, huh..."
    text: ""
  }
  npc_discuss: {
    id: 100498
    time: 1791498120
    text: "Hey! If you ask Contestant Kent, romance is about showing up for someone any time and any place!"
    npc_reply: 100499
    npc_reply: 100500
    npc_reply: 100501
    npc_reply: 100502
  }
  npc_discuss: {
    id: 100494
    time: 1791497520
    text: "Yawn... Reading all your long messages is so draining... In my opinion romance means getting to stay in bed forever and ever"
    npc_reply: 100495
    npc_reply: 100496
    npc_reply: 100497
  }
  npc_discuss: {
    id: 100491
    time: 1791496920
    text: "True romance is big calibers! Overwhelming firepower! Neverending combat! And world domination! Hahaha!"
    npc_reply: 100492
    npc_reply: 100493
  }
  npc_discuss: {
    id: 100487
    time: 1791496260
    text: "Um... I don't think romance has to be anything crazy."
    npc_reply: 100488
    npc_reply: 100489
    npc_reply: 100490
  }
  npc_discuss: {
    id: 100483
    time: 1791495660
    text: "Romance is an epic of a love that never loses its luster. People expend their hearts for those they love, till eventually they make the supreme sacrifice..."
    npc_reply: 100484
    npc_reply: 100485
    npc_reply: 100486
  }
  npc_discuss: {
    id: 100479
    time: 1791494940
    text: "Romance? It's all about fighting, growing, and heading for a brilliant future together!"
    npc_reply: 100480
    npc_reply: 100481
    npc_reply: 100482
  }
  npc_discuss: {
    id: 100475
    time: 1791494040
    text: "I'd say romance is giving everything you have for the person you love~"
    npc_reply: 100476
    npc_reply: 100477
    npc_reply: 100478
  }
  npc_discuss: {
    id: 100471
    time: 1791493320
    text: "Romance... To give some simple examples, it can be a piece of music, a bouquet of roses, or a wonderful candlelit dinner."
    npc_reply: 100472
    npc_reply: 100473
    npc_reply: 100474
  }
  npc_reply: {
    id: 100502
    time: 1791498840
    text: "I completely agree♪"
  }
  npc_reply: {
    id: 100501
    time: 1791498600
    text: "Yeah, that's just what I think!"
  }
  npc_reply: {
    id: 100500
    time: 1791498420
    text: "Right!"
  }
  npc_reply: {
    id: 100499
    time: 1791498300
    text: "You sure said it!"
  }
  npc_reply: {
    id: 100497
    time: 1791498000
    text: "I'm fine without a bed I can lie down wherever and that's romance too"
  }
  npc_reply: {
    id: 100496
    time: 1791497820
    text: "You're so right..."
  }
  npc_reply: {
    id: 100495
    time: 1791497640
    text: "Zzzz... Yep..."
  }
  npc_reply: {
    id: 100493
    time: 1791497280
    text: "You got it! That's why this greatest and strongest Black Dragon is the most romantic thing ever♪"
  }
  npc_reply: {
    id: 100492
    time: 1791497100
    text: "Wielding a colossal fury and utterly devastating the enemy. I believe such power to be an awe-inspiring romance also."
  }
  npc_reply: {
    id: 100490
    time: 1791496680
    text: "In my opinion, the most romantic thing ever is the smile exchanged between the superhero and the sidekick as their eyes meet and flames rage behind them!"
  }
  npc_reply: {
    id: 100489
    time: 1791496500
    text: "That's exactly right! Which means tokusatsu shows are romantic! Nothing more romantic than fighting to protect someone!"
  }
  npc_reply: {
    id: 100488
    time: 1791496380
    text: "Maybe romance is also having someone who protects you and makes you feel safe... someone you want to stay close to..."
  }
  npc_reply: {
    id: 100486
    time: 1791496140
    text: "There's waaay more to romance than just staring at someone! You gotta take part in it yourself! Make the right choices and lock in on that girl's route like in a galgame~"
  }
  npc_reply: {
    id: 100485
    time: 1791495960
    text: "Devotion and sacrifice... It sounds wonderful. I'm prepared to offer up everything I've got to the Commander~"
  }
  npc_reply: {
    id: 100484
    time: 1791495780
    text: "To \"keep the pledge through life or death, togetherness or separation\"... That's what you're referring to."
  }
  npc_reply: {
    id: 100482
    time: 1791495420
    text: "Banding together and achieving magnificent things. What could be more ambitious or romantic than that?"
  }
  npc_reply: {
    id: 100481
    time: 1791495240
    text: "You're right, Big Sis. I'll have to remember that."
  }
  npc_reply: {
    id: 100480
    time: 1791495060
    text: "You're a legend, Cleveland! Holding no punches and lifting our spirits! You're sooo cool!"
  }
  npc_reply: {
    id: 100478
    time: 1791494700
    text: "Exactly, nya! You've got to swing by my store for the sake of the romance industry!"
  }
  npc_reply: {
    id: 100477
    time: 1791494520
    text: "I'd sure love to see new stores and places to eat at the port."
  }
  npc_reply: {
    id: 100476
    time: 1791494280
    text: "I totally get you! Hanging out in town together, buying a ton of stuff, matching outfits... That's the best romance there is!"
  }
  npc_reply: {
    id: 100474
    time: 1791493800
    text: "Heehee, if that's your definition of romance, the Sardegna Empire will come out on top every time!"
  }
  npc_reply: {
    id: 100473
    time: 1791493680
    text: "A candlelit dinner is even more wonderful with the addition of tea."
  }
  npc_reply: {
    id: 100472
    time: 1791493500
    text: "Speaking of roses, I've been cultivating lots of new varieties in the greenhouse~ Romance would also be watching them bloom little by little."
  }
